### Variables
@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Gateway Health Check
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/health HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 2. Gateway Root (Catalog of available public routes)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/ HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Verify Internal Lookup Route is Blocked (Returns 404 from Gateway)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/internal/v1/products/lookup?ids=019488a0-0000-7000-8000-000000000001 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Verify Gateway Stamps Correlation Header (X-Trace-Id)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
